{"steam_appid":2693060,"steam_name":"Garten of Banban 7","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2693060/687000/d84ad8ec77ad0fc767f5746fa8acbc6cf8a55841/1750818768/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1713017095","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257015674/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1713017095","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693060/ss_cb69f9e0b7b6ca691b9749cebb5b2891dbaa9532.1920x1080.jpg?t=1751060750","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693060/ss_b06320421035923904412e48d1bb0c35c1c66fb5.1920x1080.jpg?t=1751060750","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693060/ss_c1b3164eaa2deb269d1d17a5693118fbfd4831ec.1920x1080.jpg?t=1751060750","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693060/ss_cc553b93f710faa4f0990642cb475ede25d7e6cd.1920x1080.jpg?t=1751060750","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693060/ss_2c535cf595c314313c5bd4fca997f5abd6cd3ba7.1920x1080.jpg?t=1751060750"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Explore the monster-occupied levels of Banban’s Kindergarten. Survive the dreads that reside below as you are now completely on your own. Uncover the truth behind the place, and find the whereabouts of your missing child…</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693060/extras/06823dce7e580397ca2d8b512272fb71.poster.avif?t=1751060750\" width=600 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693060/extras/06823dce7e580397ca2d8b512272fb71.webm?t=1751060750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693060/extras/06823dce7e580397ca2d8b512272fb71.mp4?t=1751060750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive the monster-occupied levels of Banban’s Kindergarten:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the latest events, you were separated from your friends. Delve deeper into the mysterious establishment that is Banban’s kindergarten. You are now completely on your own and the future of everything depends on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693060/extras/30ef04a9643ae4b0b01951baeb188d73.poster.avif?t=1751060750\" width=600 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693060/extras/30ef04a9643ae4b0b01951baeb188d73.webm?t=1751060750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693060/extras/30ef04a9643ae4b0b01951baeb188d73.mp4?t=1751060750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693060/extras/360227acc9e124cb5749daddc2ad7f05.poster.avif?t=1751060750\" width=600 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693060/extras/360227acc9e124cb5749daddc2ad7f05.webm?t=1751060750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693060/extras/360227acc9e124cb5749daddc2ad7f05.mp4?t=1751060750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No more friends to make…</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have run out of friends to make. From now on, you only meet new enemies who will make sure you never feel alone! In Banban’s Kindergarten, there are enemies to be made in every corner... and pouch!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693060/extras/3173298388f3cf1acc4e696bc4d95403.poster.avif?t=1751060750\" width=600 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693060/extras/3173298388f3cf1acc4e696bc4d95403.webm?t=1751060750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693060/extras/3173298388f3cf1acc4e696bc4d95403.mp4?t=1751060750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693060/extras/84303ce708744b69c60058cb0636f79f.poster.avif?t=1751060750\" width=600 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693060/extras/84303ce708744b69c60058cb0636f79f.webm?t=1751060750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693060/extras/84303ce708744b69c60058cb0636f79f.mp4?t=1751060750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 2.5 GHz Quad-core Intel or AMD processor<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> There are settings to change the graphics setting for lower end devices</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"","genres":["Action","Adventure","Casual","Indie"],"developers":["Euphoric Brothers"],"publishers":["Euphoric Brothers"],"release_date":"10 May, 2024"}